To publish a post:

  1. Create newsletter/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md or abk/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md with
  frontmatter (title, date, description)
  2. Write content in standard markdown — tables, images, code blocks all work
  now
  3. For images: sips -Z 1200 photo.jpg --out uploads/your-folder/photo.jpg (add
  sips -s format jpeg photo.HEIC --out photo.jpg first if iPhone photos)
  4. python3 extract_posts.py && git add -A && git commit -m "..." && git push

